      "category": "Policy",
      "description": "Recommendation 1: Allow CPT 59430 and Z39.0-Z39.2 only for postpartum-only care with no antepartum care and no delivery services; deny separate postpartum-only billing when delivery services such as 59510 or 59515 are present, and limit use to 8 weeks after cesarean delivery or 6 weeks after vaginal delivery. Exempt: postpartum care only, routine postpartum care only. Peer: Cigna Commercial bundles maternity globally and allows CPT 59430 only for postpartum-only care with no antepartum care or delivery services, limited to 6 weeks after vaginal delivery and 8 weeks after cesarean delivery..\n\nRecommendation 2: When CPT 59430 is billed for a postpartum complication visit on the same claim as E&M 99202, require modifier 25 on the E&M line; otherwise deny the separate E&M payment. Peer: Cigna Commercial requires modifier 25 when CPT 59430 is billed on the same claim as an E&M such as 99202 for a postpartum complication visit..",
